/*
  AiLimitBanner.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0025 · AiLimitBanner (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The keys mirror the web source
  (components/ai/AiLimitBanner.tsx) one-for-one — the action labels, the live countdown line, and
  the full reason taxonomy (titleForReason / descriptionForReason) — plus the native P4 leaf chrome
  (dismiss, freshness, loading / empty / error) so the Swift sources hold no English literals. These
  entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are
  kept in a per-surface table ("AiLimitBanner") so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings
  without editing the shared catalog.
*/

/* --- Actions (web `Button` labels) --- */
"ai.limit.useBaseline" = "Use baseline";
